    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging levels on single-player or multiplayer (2-4 players). Players can complete the game from level 1. Also, players can freely choose all unlocked levels from the start. Gameplay is easy as you can think of a casual game just completing on each level, but do not forget this is Another Level game that is different from usual levels. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random gameplay :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and different gameplay for some levels. There will be interesting gameplay that players may have never experienced before. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer playing with friend :\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging levels with a friend (2-4 players). Those who knock out first will be watching other players until they finish the level. The game will restart level once all players have lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging and unique level :\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels might be hard or easy with unique and good seeing graphics. There are some strange platforms or level that can make players lose from the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging levels on single-player or multiplayer (2-4 players). Players can complete the game from level 1. Also, players can freely choose all unlocked levels from the start. Gameplay is easy as you can think of a casual game just completing on each level, but do not forget this is Another Level game that is different from usual levels. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random gameplay :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and different gameplay for some levels. There will be interesting gameplay that players may have never experienced before. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer playing with friend :\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging levels with a friend (2-4 players). Those who knock out first will be watching other players until they finish the level. The game will restart level once all players have lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging and unique level :\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels might be hard or easy with unique and good seeing graphics. There are some strange platforms or level that can make players lose from the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
